From: slice-runners lane <lane@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:24:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(contracts): call-free check on UniswapV2ERC20 runtime

The exact runtime bytes (generated at build by
scripts/verify/uniswap_v2_runtime.sh, not committed) fail
AssembleNoCall.callFree: permit's STATICCALL at 903 and return-data
reads at 1158, 1161 and 1162. Controls: scrubbing exactly those
instructions passes the check; keeping the STATICCALL is refused.
One kernel evaluation per module, each under 6 GB.
